   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One line: ask \"will waiting fix it?\" for transient, \"is it only this message?\" for permanent, and when you cannot tell, retry a bounded number of times and\nthen park it with evidence.",
   "originalText": "One line: ask \"will waiting fix it?\" for transient, \"is it only this message?\" for permanent, and when you cannot tell, retry a bounded number of times and\nthen park it with evidence.",
