   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The primary-key conflict never surfaces as an error in EventPulse, because the insert uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING. A duplicate is a normal event, counted as a duplicate\n(S3-F3), not a failure.",
   "originalText": "The primary-key conflict never surfaces as an error in EventPulse, because the insert uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING. A duplicate is a normal event, counted as a duplicate\n(S3-F3), not a failure.",
