   "text": "Frequent mistake: \"every 5xx is transient\". A 500 caused by a deterministic bug on one payload never heals: give it the same bounded-count cap as any unknown.",
   "originalText": "Frequent mistake: \"every 5xx is transient\". A 500 caused by a deterministic bug on one payload never heals: give it the same bounded-count cap as any unknown.",
