   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "This is the design rule from the note. The current batch-handler.ts rethrows every TRANSIENT or SYSTEMIC error at any bisection depth, so a repeating 57014 pauses the partition; it is not\nturned into a dead letter.",
   "originalText": "This is the design rule from the note. The current batch-handler.ts rethrows every TRANSIENT or SYSTEMIC error at any bisection depth, so a repeating 57014 pauses the partition; it is not\nturned into a dead letter.",
