   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "In errors.ts / batch-handler.ts, SYSTEMIC_DB is \"blocking\" exactly like TRANSIENT_DB: it is retried with backoff inside the window, then the partition is paused. The difference is that it needs\na human. It is never dead-lettered.",
