   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Transient: the same operation on the same input can succeed later with nobody changing anything (40P01\ndeadlock). Permanent: it cannot succeed until something changes (22P02 invalid text).",
   "originalText": "Transient: the same operation on the same input can succeed later with nobody changing anything (40P01\ndeadlock). Permanent: it cannot succeed until something changes (22P02 invalid text).",
